{"id": "34503", "title": "霸道也温柔", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 40, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34503.htm", "intro": "射箭的女人最美丽,任他石头脾气也得变成绕指柔,只是,这样的温柔人家可不欣赏,一日为对头冤家,终身难辞其罪。\r\n　　大丈夫能区能伸,温柔不成,霸道也可以,爱就是把她请回家金屋藏娇,可这华服美食也动不了小妮子的心,三番两次的用唇攻城掠地全都无功而反。爱一个人如此辛苦,他都快打退堂鼓了没想到－－她竟屈服在他的「心痛」下,还千里迢迢、跋山涉水为他找解药,最最意外的是,解药却成了毒药？！这可如何是好,难道到手的爱情就这么飞了？！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34503", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2188988.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2188989.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188990.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188991.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188992.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188993.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188994.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188995.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188996.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188997.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188998.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188999.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2189000.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2189001.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2189002.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2189003.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2189004.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2189005.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2189006.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2189007.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2189008.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2189009.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2189010.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2189011.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2189012.html", "ava